    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by the Section 154C of the Constitution of the Democratic Socialist Republic of SriLanka, I, Marshall Perera, Governor of the Sabaragamuwa Province, under Sub-section (08) of Section 03 of the RoadPassenger Transport Authority Statute No. 01 of 1994 of the Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council, do by this Order removethe below mentioned officers from the office of the Chairman/Director of the Sabaragamuwa Province Road PassengerTransport Authority constituted by the said Statute.",
